@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "How it works";
}
<section class="page-hero"><div class="shell"><div class="eyebrow">HOW IT WORKS</div><h1>One marketplace. Two auction experiences.</h1><p>Timed online auctions and camera-enabled live auctions serve different sellers without compromising bidder clarity.</p></div></section>
<section class="section shell">
    <div class="format-comparison">
        <article><div class="number">01</div><h2>HammerTrack Online</h2><p>Catalog bidding similar to established online auction marketplaces.</p><ol><li>Auctioneer publishes lots and terms.</li><li>Bidder creates an account and registers.</li><li>Maximum bids compete by configured increments.</li><li>Soft closing protects against last-second sniping.</li><li>Winner checks out through the auction company's connected processor.</li></ol></article>
        <article><div class="number">02</div><h2>HammerTrack Live</h2><p>A scheduled event with remote camera participation.</p><ol><li>Bidder registers and receives a number.</li><li>Camera and microphone are checked before admission.</li><li>Raise Paddle moves the bidder into the active queue.</li><li>Auctioneer or clerk accepts each bid.</li><li>Seller sends payment instructions after the event.</li></ol></article>
    </div>
</section>
